{1 Compile Times}

Times from a cold release build with the generally recommended build system,
which hurts D and Nim - both get under 3 s with direct compiler use.  ATS
skipped as I couldn't easily build it (and only the argv handling is
interesting at all).

Times are wallclock, which helps Go (22.7s compile time by user+sys).

